netgate/fuzz/target/

# Working notes for a person, not part of the tree.
scratch/
.scratch/

# The window's seam types, written from the Rust by `just ui`.  Generated
# on demand so there is one copy of the fact and no stale checked-in twin.
synod/ui/js/bindings/

